{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do what the voice tells you, no matter how wrong it feels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes to a bare room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No windows. No doors. No escape. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete each daily task.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a bed, a table, a bathroom, and a voice that speaks when you wake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each morning, it gives you a task. At first, they seem harmless\u2014simple chores in a place that shouldn\u2019t exist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by the second day, the tone shifts. The tasks grow darker, more personal, more invasive. You begin to wonder what the voice wants from you\u2014or if it wants you to become something else. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How far will you go to survive when there\u2019s no way out?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only rule: obey the voice for seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What a rotten way to die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043620/f2fb4d40c5bb4a031199a9e485cf75a2f1ea2d86.jpg"},{"name":"Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043620/f2fb4d40c5bb4a031199a9e485cf75a2f1ea2d86.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043620?t=1762178198","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043620?t=1762178198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043620/c367c403754ed6701abde5450151bfabb680fe7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762178198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043620/c367c403754ed6701abde5450151bfabb680fe7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762178198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Romb contains depictions of suicide & self harm via sound effects and in-game graphics.\r\n\r\nThere are also visible depictions of blood via in-game graphics."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do what the voice tells you, no matter how wrong it feels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes to a bare room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No windows. No doors. No escape. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete each daily task.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a bed, a table, a bathroom, and a voice that speaks when you wake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each morning, it gives you a task. At first, they seem harmless\u2014simple chores in a place that shouldn\u2019t exist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by the second day, the tone shifts. The tasks grow darker, more personal, more invasive. You begin to wonder what the voice wants from you\u2014or if it wants you to become something else. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How far will you go to survive when there\u2019s no way out?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only rule: obey the voice for seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lots of Logic Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043620/311b4149eb7bb26f9ad1c7de471ef2b0139225de/header.jpg?t=1762178198","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043620/215326465/148fe29ca26bd5ddaa0c82756b1e9d91858315b0/1760483768/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761015268","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043620/215